factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script opens by saying Sirithuli urged restoring the 8 ponds, then says 'இதையடுத்து' (following this) the meeting happened, implying a causal link the article does not state; the article does not say the meeting was prompted by that call.
  The reel_script says the Chief Secretary gave advice that existing efforts failed to yield expected results and 'urged exploring alternative technologies' — the article says the earlier efforts did not give expected results and he advised that practical solutions could be developed through alternative technologies and innovative methods; roughly matching, but the reel_script's 'ஆராயுமாறு' phrasing is acceptable.
  The reel_script says the Sirithuli officials 'பங்கேற்றனர்' (participated) in the meeting, which is consistent, but the claim that Sirithuli 'promised' to continue contributing with government and Corporation is only partially reflected; the reel_script says 'உறுதியளித்துள்ளது' which is consistent with the article.
  The slides_spec line 'மாநகரின் 8 குளங்களை விரைந்து சீரமைக்க வலியுறுத்தல்' and 'கழிவுச் சேறு ... நீர் கொள்ளளவு உயர்த்துதல்' are consistent with the article; no invented figures found, but the caption and headline use the 8-pond call as the lead fact, which the article frames as a point raised during the meeting rather than a standalone statement.
